              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आवश्यक — āvaśyak — \"essential, required (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर बीमारी गंभीर है तो आराम आवश्यक है। agar bīmārī gambhīr hai to ārām āvaśyak hai. If the illness is serious, rest is essential."
